% The old dialect's long variable names: `Значение'` is one variable, not a name
% with a stray quote (task_77).  The file declares no naming mode of its own, so the
% mode has to come from `--vars` — which is what the checks next to this file vary,
% and both `1` and `2` have to read the name.
факт(7).
?факт(Значение'),ВЫВОД(Значение'),ПС.
